{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05912","headline":"寓言二首 一 · 王维","name":"寓言二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱绂谁家子，无乃金张孙。\n骊驹从白马，出入铜龙门。\n问尔何功德，多承明主恩。\n鬬鸡平乐馆，射雉上林园。\n曲陌车骑盛，高堂珠翠繁。\n奈何轩冕贵，不与布衣言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}